<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Order Form — {{docNo}}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/base.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">

  {{> mast company=company docTitle="Order Form" docNo=docNo docPill=docPill}}
  {{#if company.phone}}<div class="addr" style="margin-top:4px;">{{company.phone}}{{#if company.email}} &middot; {{company.email}}{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}

  <!-- 01 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>01 &mdash; Buyer &amp; Delivery</span><b>{{statusBanner}}</b></div>
    <div class="kv">
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Buyer</span><span class="v">{{buyerName}}{{#if buyerLegalName}}<br><span class="muted">{{buyerLegalName}}</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">GSTIN</span><span class="v">{{buyerGstin}}{{#if buyerState}} &middot; <span class="muted">{{buyerState}}</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Contact</span><span class="v">{{dash buyerContact}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Ship To</span><span class="v">{{shipTo}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Order Date</span><span class="v">{{orderDate}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Delivery By</span><span class="v">{{deliveryBy}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Payment</span><span class="v">{{payment}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Approved By</span><span class="v">{{dash approvedBy}}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 02 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>02 &mdash; Styles Ordered</span><b>{{itemsBanner}}</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:28px">#</th><th>Style</th><th style="width:56px">HSN</th>
            <th style="width:76px">Delivery</th><th style="width:62px">Status</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:56px">Qty</th><th class="num" style="width:66px">Rate ₹</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:88px">Value ₹</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each items}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.style}}<br><span class="muted">{{this.styleName}}</span></td><td>{{this.hsn}}</td><td>{{this.delivery}}</td><td>{{this.status}}</td><td class="num">{{this.qty}}</td><td class="num">{{this.rate}}</td><td class="num">{{this.value}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr class="sub"><td colspan="5">Sum of lines</td><td class="num">{{lineQtyTotal}}</td><td></td><td class="num">{{lineValueTotal}}</td></tr>
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">Order total &mdash; exclusive of GST</td><td class="num">{{orderQtyTotal}}</td><td></td><td class="num">{{orderValueTotal}}</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div class="callout">
      <b>What this document commits</b>
      Signed, this form <strong>authorises production</strong> of the styles and quantities above: BOM, material
      requirement planning, procurement and cutting are released against it, and material bought to it is committed
      to this order. It does <strong>not</strong> commit tax &mdash; this is <strong>not an invoice</strong>, no GST is
      charged on it and it creates no input credit for the buyer. The tax charge arises only on the tax invoice raised
      at despatch, which is what the buyer records and claims against.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  {{#if grids.length}}
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>03 &mdash; Size &amp; Colour Breakdown</span><b>Cutting ratio</b></div>
    {{#each grids}}
    <table {{#unless @first}}style="margin-top:10px;"{{/unless}}>
      <thead>
        <tr><th colspan="{{this.spanAll}}">{{this.style}} &mdash; {{this.styleName}}</th></tr>
        <tr><th>Colour</th>{{#each this.sizes}}<th class="num" style="width:54px">{{this}}</th>{{/each}}<th class="num" style="width:72px">Total</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each this.rows}}
        <tr{{#if this.open}} class="open"{{/if}}><td>{{this.colour}}</td>{{#each this.cells}}<td class="num">{{this}}</td>{{/each}}<td class="num">{{this.total}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{#if this.handFill}}
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="{{this.spanLabel}}">Ratio not yet recorded &mdash; complete by hand, must total</td><td class="num">{{this.gridTotal}}</td></tr>
        {{else}}
        <tr class="sub"><td>Per size</td>{{#each this.colTotals}}<td class="num">{{this}}</td>{{/each}}<td class="num">{{this.gridTotal}}</td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{/each}}
    {{#if anyHandFill}}
    <div class="callout">
      <b>Do not cut against an unconfirmed ratio</b>
      Where the grid above is blank the order carries no size breakup in the system. Fabric is consumed per size, so a
      lay planned on an assumed ratio produces the wrong sizes at the right total &mdash; unsellable against the buyer&rsquo;s
      pack. Record the ratio in the order before raising the cutting plan.
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  <!-- 04 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>04 &mdash; Terms</span><b>Internal &middot; Standard</b></div>
    {{#if remarks}}<div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:7px;">Remarks &mdash; {{remarks}}</div>{{/if}}
    <ol class="terms">
      <li>Quantities and rates above are the confirmed order. Any revision needs a written amendment quoting {{docNo}} &mdash; a verbal change is not actioned and will not be costed.</li>
      <li>Delivery by {{deliveryBy}} ex-factory. Slippage must be flagged to merchandising the day it is known, not at the delivery date.</li>
      <li>Goods are made to the approved sample and specification. Fabric, trims and packing follow the approved BOM for this order.</li>
      <li>Buyer testing requirements configured on the customer master (FPT / GPT) apply to this order and gate production or shipment accordingly.</li>
      <li>Payment {{paymentClause}}, against the tax invoice raised at despatch. This form is not an invoice and is not to be entered in either party&rsquo;s tax records.</li>
      <li>Subject to Jaipur jurisdiction.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="sign">
    <div>Merchandising &mdash; Prepared by</div>
    <div>For {{company.name}} &mdash; Authorised Signatory</div>
    <div>Production &mdash; Accepted for planning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    <span>{{docNo}} &middot; Page 1 of 1</span>
    <span>Copy: Merchandising &middot; Production &middot; Store &middot; Accounts</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
